<<SamOptions>>

:: Sam Park Walk
<<effects>>
<<npc Sam>><<person1>>
You decide to go on a walk together.
<br><br>
<<cleareventpool>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_walk_1" 1>>
	You walk away from the bridge with Sam.
	<<switch random(1,4)>>
		<<case 1>>You walk past the fountain, past the toilets, and around the various other parts of the park. It's calming.<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
		<<case 2>>You end up walking by the toilets, <span class="lewd">you hear a few lewd noises inside.</span> You wonder what's going on inside, but Sam keeps walking before you can check.<<arousal 5>><<garousal>>
		<<case 3>>You walk nearby the river, you watch a few ducks wade in the water, as you walk along.
		<<default>>Sam takes a few pictures of the local scenery as you walk around.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	It doesn't take long for you to end up back where you started.
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_walk_2" 1>>
	<<switch Time.season>>
		<<case "winter">><<= Weather.precipitation is "snow" ? "The pair of you walk around the snowy park." : "It is fairly cold outside, but the walk keeps you warm.">>
		<<case "autumn">>You notice the tree's leaves are becoming orange.
		<<case "spring">>Your eyes wander to the flowers beginning to bloom.
		<<default>>It feels a bit hot outside, but not too unbearable just yet.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	It doesn't take long for you to walk around the park.
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if $athletics gte 400>>
	<<addinlineevent "sam_walk_3" 1>>
		You and Sam walk around the park. You notice that <<he>> has trouble keeping up with you, but doesn't say anything. Eventually, you end up back where you started, with Sam puffing a bit behind you.<<gathletics>><<athletics 1>>
		<br><br>

		"That sure was fast! You're quite a speed walker, aren't you?"
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_walk_4" 1>>
	While on your walk, Sam pauses by the toilets.
	<br><br>

	"I'll be right back," <<he>> says, heading into the washroom.
	<br><br>

	It's fairly quiet at this time of morning, and it doesn't take Sam long to come back out.
	<br><br>

	"Let's keep going!"
	<br><br>

	You continue your walk, ending up back where you started.
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_walk_5" 1>>
	<<generate2>><<person2>>
	While on your walk with Sam,
	<<switch random(1,4)>>
		<<case 1>>a <<person>> whistles in your direction.
		<<case 2>>you feel someone's gaze on your bottom.
		<<case 3>>you notice the lingering gaze.
		<<case 4>>a <<person>> stops you to ask for your number. You tell <<him>> you don't have a phone.
		<<case 5>>a <<person>> interrupts to flirt with you.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	Sam avoids the other person's gaze, pretending not to see anything. You walk back to the bridge without any further incident.
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_walk_6" .5>>
	<<set _no_options to true>>
	<<generate2>>
	While on your walk, Sam pauses by the toilets.
	<br><br>

	"I'll be right back," <<person1>><<he>> says, heading into the washroom.
	<br><br>

	While waiting for Sam, a <<person2>><<person>> walks up to you.
	<br><br>

	"Hey, <<girl>>. What are you doing here all by yourself? I heard there's a little slut hiding around the toilets. You wouldn't happen to be <<phim>>, would you?"
	<br><br>

	<<He>> reaches over to grab your shoulder, clearly up to no good.<<stress 5>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Sam Park Harassment]]>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if $chef_state gte 2>>
	<<addinlineevent "sam_walk_7" 1>>
		<<generate2>>
		While on your walk, a <<person2>><<person>> stops you.
		<br><br>

		"Aren't you the one behind those delicious cream buns at the Ocean Breeze Cafe?"
		<br><br>

		"Why yes!" Sam gloats. "The star chef is right here!"
		<br><br>

		Sam pats you on the back, you feel appreciated.
		<br><br>

		<<if $chef_sus gte 50>>
			"I heard that they're made with real human 'milk' is that true?" the <<person>> asks. "I'd love to try it from the source!"<<stress 3>><<arousal 5>><<gstress>><<garousal>>
			<br><br>

			Sam's eyes narrow.
			<br><br>

			"Those are utterly ludicrous rumours. I would never allow such a thing in my establishment. I'll have you know our cream buns are made with real milk, not whatever you're imagining."
			<br><br>

			The person looks a bit disappointed, but seems to believe Sam.
			<br><br>

		<</if>>
		You both walk away from the <<person>>, you can at least tell Sam appreciates your efforts. Even if <<person1>><<he>> is unaware of how you actually make the cream buns.<<npcincr Sam love 1>><<glove>>
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<addinlineevent "sam_walk_8" .7>>
		While on your walk, a few customers from the cafe pop up. They eagerly greet you and Sam, raving about your cream buns and praising Sam's service.
		<br><br>

		Sam sheepishly accepts their compliments, and so do you.<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
		<br><br>

		You walk around the park after saying goodbye to your admirers.
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_walk_9" .4>>
	You are walking alongside Sam when you hear a noise. A creature comes out of the bushes.
	<br><br>

	It's a badger.
	<br><br>

	"Aw! Look at what we have here!"
	<br><br>

	Sam crouches down, staying a short distance away from the animal. <<He>> takes out <<his>> phone and happily takes a bunch of pictures of the badger. It stares at Sam curiously for a few moments before scurrying off.
	<br><br>

	"Badgers are really cute, aren't they?"
	<br><br>

	Sam shows you the photos <<he>> took. <<He>> seems pretty proud of them. It does look pretty cute in the photos.<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>

	You end up walking back the way you came after a few moments.
<</addinlineevent>>

<<runeventpool>>
<br><br>
<<SamOptions>>

:: Sam Park Harassment
<<effects>>

"Um, excuse me..."
<br><br>
Sam appears behind the <<person>>, sheepishly pushing <<his>> hand away.
<br><br>
"That's my... <<pniece>> you're touching," <<person1>><<he>> says, rubbing <<his>> head.
<br><br>
The <<person2>><<person>> gives Sam an annoyed glare before pushing past <<person1>><<him>>.
<br><br>
Sam doesn't say anything else as you walk back to the bridge.
<br><br>

<<SamOptions>>

:: Sam Park Duck
<<effects>>
<<npc Sam>><<person1>>
<<set _duck to ["horde of ducks", "pair of ducks", "group of ducklings and their parents", "bunch of ducks", "flock of ducks"]>>
<<cleareventpool>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_duck_feed_1" 1>>
	You go to feed the ducks with Sam. There is a <<print _duck.pluck()>>.
	<br><br>

	They
	<<switch random(1,4)>>
		<<case 1>>happily eat up the corn, they seem to be pleased by your presence.<<stress -3>><<tending 2>><<lstress>><<gtending>>
		<<case 2>>greedily eat up the corn, it seems like they will never be satisfied at this rate.<<stress 3>><<gstress>>
		<<case 3>>quickly eat up the food. You can tell they enjoyed the meal.<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
		<<default>>hurriedly eat up the corn, it looks like they haven't eaten in a while.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	The ducks waddle away soon after.
<</addinlineevent>>


<<addinlineevent "sam_duck_feed_2" 1>>
	"Here you go," Sam says, tossing some corn to the ducks. The <<print _duck.pluck()>> perk up and begin nibbling on the food.
	<br><br>

	They
	<<switch random(1,4)>>
		<<case 1>>happily eat up the corn, they seem to be pleased by Sam's affection.<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
		<<case 2>>quickly eat up the food. You can tell they enjoyed the meal.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
		<<case 3>>greedily eat up the corn which makes Sam laugh.
		<<default>>hurriedly eat up the corn, it looks like they haven't eaten in a while. Sam lets out a nervous laugh.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	The ducks waddle away soon after.
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_duck_feed_3" 1>>
	You go to feed the ducks with Sam, and you decide to hand-feed them this time.
	<br><br>

	<<if currentSkillValue("tending") gte random (1, 200)>>
		A <<print _duck.pluck()>> eat up all the corn in your hand, you feel their little bills brush up against your hands a few times. It's pleasant.<<stress -10>><<tending 2>><<llstress>><<gtending>>
	<<else>>
		A <<print _duck.pluck()>> simply look at you and
		<<switch random(1,3)>>
			<<case 1>>bite you. You step back, Sam gives a little laugh at your expense.<<stress 3>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
			<<case 2>>slobber all over your hand, you flinch and drop some of the corn on the floor. It's a bit embarrassing.<<stress 2>><<gstress>>
			<<default>>ignore your hand.
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_duck_feed_4" 1>>
	You go to feed the ducks, but notice there aren't any around this time. You wait around but don't even hear a quack. Sam looks a bit disappointed, but instead passes the time talking to you.
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if $worn.upper.name isnot "naked" or $worn.lower.name isnot "naked">>
	<<addinlineevent "sam_duck_feed_5" .5>>
		<<set _no_options to true>>
		While you're feeding the ducks, one of them watches you with a strange gleam in its eyes. You have a feeling this duck isn't interested in the food alone. It eyes your <<if $worn.upper.name is "naked">><<bottoms>><<else>><<top>><</if>>, ready to pounce.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Calm the creature|Sam Park Duck Attack]]>><<set $phase to "calm">><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 400 1200>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Do nothing|Sam Park Duck Attack]]>><<set $phase to "nothing">><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "sam_duck_feed_6" .7>>
	<<set _no_options to true>>
	You're feeding the ducks when you notice something.
	<br><br>

	In front of you are two ducks... and a goose.
	<br><br>

	The creature eyes you, as if waiting for your next move.
	<br><br>

	What will you do?
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Feed|Sam Park Goose]]>><<set $phase to "feed">><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 600 1200>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Ignore|Sam Park Goose]]>><<set $phase to "ignore">><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<runeventpool>>
<br><br>

<<SamOptions>>

:: Sam Park Goose
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is "feed">>
	You decide to just feed the goose, it's just another animal, right?
	<br><br>

	<<if $tendingSuccess>>
		The goose pauses <span class="green">and then accepts your offering.</span> It lets out a pleased noise after it finishes.<<tending 9>><<ggtending>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">The goose ignores your offerings and waddles away.</span>
		<br><br>

		You feel a bit insulted.<<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	You ignore the goose. It doesn't seem that happy with that. It seems ready to rip the food right out of your hands.<<stress 10>><<ggstress>>
	<br><br>

	"Get away!" Sam shouts at the creature. "What a greedy thing... You okay? Geese can be a bit unruly at times."
<</if>>
<br><br>
After it leaves you go back to feeding the other two ducks.
<br><br>

<<SamOptions>>

:: Sam Park Duck Attack
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is "calm" and $tendingSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You manage to avoid the duck's bill as it jumps at you by tossing some food towards it.</span> It seems preoccupied with the corn and focuses on eating.
<<else>>
	<span class="red">The duck jumps right at your <<if $worn.upper.name is "naked">><<bottoms>><<else>><<top>><</if>>.</span> You manage to push the creature off before it can rip it right off, but it leaves your clothes worse for wear.
	<<set $stripintegrity to 10>><<set $stripobject to "a duck">><<stripobject>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
Sam looks apologetic after the fact.
<br><br>
"Some of them can be a bit devious, so be careful!"
<br><br>

<<SamOptions>>

:: Sam Loft
<<effects>>
"So, I was wondering..." Sam continues. "There's a little something I wanted to give you, well, for you and the other orphans over at the orphanage... want to get a little kitchen upgrade?"
<br><br>
You start to wonder what exactly Sam is planning to give you, but before you can, <<he>> speaks up again.
<br><br>
"Oh, wait, I should ask your guardian about that right?"
<br><br>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"Ah," you whimper. "Bailey hates us touching anything in the kitchen..."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Ah fuck," you bite your lip. "Bailey would for sure blow a fuse if you touched anything in the kitchen."
<<else>>
	"Ugh," you grumble. "If it's the kitchen, that's a big 'no-no', my 'guardian' would throw a hissy fit if we touched anything there."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Sam pouts, looking visibly defeated.
<br><br>
"Is there nowhere else you have access to that your guardian wouldn't mind us touching?"
<br><br>

<<if $loft_known is 1>>
	<<lofticon>><<link [[Tell Sam about the orphanage loft|Sam Loft 2]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<icon "cross.png">><<link [[Say No|Sam Loft Refuse]]>><<set $loft_sam_refuse to 1>><</link>>

:: Sam Loft Refuse
<<effects>>

You shake your head.
<br><br>
Sam sighs, and gives you a light pat on the shoulder.
<br><br>
"Well, if you do end up getting a private space for you and the other orphans, let me know, alright? The offer still stands, and I really want you to have it."
<br><br>
<<SamOptions>>

:: Sam Loft 2
<<effects>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"Wait... Sam," you say. "There is a place where Bailey wouldn't care if anything was touched, it's a big loft."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Hey, we do have a place for your little gift," you say. "It's this big loft up in the orphanage."
<<else>>
	"Actually, Sam," you say. "We have this loft in the orphanage. That gift of yours could go up there."
<</if>>
<br><br>
Sam's eyes light up at your words.
<br><br>
"Really? That's great! You know it's really not a big thing or anything," Sam laughs bashfully. "Now I feel all tense. I hope you end up liking it. I have it over at my home, why don't we head over there and I can give it to you?"
<br><br>

<<link [[Walk to <<nnpc_his "Sam">> house (0:15)|Sam Loft 3]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>

:: Sam Loft 3
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "flats">><<effects>>

You leave the park with Sam. You notice that <<he>> looks fairly nervous. You eventually arrive at Barb Street, and the pair of you head over to the flats. You stop as Sam does, with <<his>> eyes on one of the doors.
<br><br>
"Sorry, it's a bit of a mess inside," Sam laughs awkwardly.
<br><br>
<<He>> then opens the door and shows you inside. It is as <<he>> said, quite cluttered. You notice a bunch of boxes scattered around, and other things. A few look to be related to the cafe, such as boxes of coffee or advertisements. There's a bit of dust here and there as well, clearly from lack of use.
<br><br>
Sam leads you over to the kitchen. You take a seat. <<He>> fumbles around the space for a few moments.
<br><br>
"Ah, sorry, I haven't really used this kitchen in a long while," <<he>> laughs. "It's got to be around here somewhere... Ah!"
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Sam Loft 4]]>><</link>>

:: Sam Loft 4
<<effects>>

Your eyes land on a coffee pot. It looks well-kept and shiny.
<br><br>
"I wanted to give you this. First, though, why don't I show you how it works?"
<br><br>
<<He>> doesn't wait for your reply, and instead gets to work.
<br><br>
"It's pretty easy, you just put the water in the back compartment. This part here? You lift it up, put a coffee filter and put the coffee grinds there. Ah, don't worry about where to get the coffee itself from, I can supply that all for you!"
<br><br>
Sam continues to explain how the coffee pot works, setting it up to brew quietly. After a few moments of silence <<he>> speaks up.
<br><br>
"Have you ever had a time where you just had to keep going to do something?"
<br><br>

<<link [[Nod|Sam Loft 5]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Shake head|Sam Loft 5]]>><</link>>

:: Sam Loft 5
<<effects>>

"I have, or I guess I still have that dream," Sam says.
<br><br>
"You see, when I had just opened the cafe up... I'd brew myself something every morning with this. This is what would keep me going each morning, a quick cup of coffee. It would give me just enough juice to get through the day... I really just couldn't think about anything else but making the cafe into something. Even when I had four hours of sleep and was just barely keeping it together."
<br><br>
<<He>> laughs boisterously as you hear the sound of <<him>> pouring the coffee into two mugs. Sam takes a seat across from you, drinking <<his>> coffee as <<he>> talks.
<br><br>
"Whenever I needed a little extra energy, I'd rely on this. I haven't used it in a long time, since I can just make my coffee at the cafe, but... I thought you'd like it. Have a try! I put a bit of milk and sugar in it, that's how I usually take it."
<br><br>

<<link [[Take a sip|Sam Loft 6]]>><<set $phase to "sip">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Chug the whole cup|Sam Loft 6]]>><<set $phase to "chug">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Politely refuse|Sam Loft 6]]>><<set $phase to "refuse">><</link>>

:: Sam Loft 6
<<effects>>
<<wearProp "coffee">>

<<if $phase is "refuse">>
	"No worries, not everyone is a coffee person!" Sam laughs. "I'll just have myself another cup."
<<elseif $phase is "chug">>
	You chug the whole cup. It burns your tongue.<<pain 3>><<gpain>>
	<br><br>

	Sam bursts out laughing. "Be careful there! I know I just can't live without it. I just hope you don't gain a caffeine addiction!"<<npcincr Sam love 1>><<glove>>
<<else>>
	You take a sip. Sam smiles at you, <<he>> seems happy that you had a taste.<<npcincr Sam love 1>><<glove>>
	<br><br>

	"I know everyone has different tastes when it comes to coffee. I hope the cup I made is to your taste."
<</if>>
<br><br>
You and Sam make some small talk over the cups of coffee. While you don't talk about anything specific, it's pleasant to be around someone who cares about you.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next (0:15)|Sam Loft 7]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>

:: Sam Loft 7
<<effects>>

The coffee cups are emptied, and you watch as Sam cleans up the coffee pot. After washing it, <<he>> puts it into a box.
<br><br>
"I put some different coffee blends inside, so you can pick whichever type catches your fancy," Sam says, handing you the box.
<br><br>
You thank Sam for the gift.
<br><br>
"No problem! I hope that you and the other orphans enjoy it! I won't keep you any longer. You better get that all set up, just be sure to not go crazy on your caffeine intake once it's running!"
<br><br>
Sam leads you out of <<his>> apartment.
<br><br>
"I should head back to work, I don't want to be late," Sam says, looking at the time. "If you ever need anything, don't be a stranger! You know where I'm at!"
<br><br>
You both go your separate ways, with you heading towards the orphanage and Sam heading to work.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next (0:05)|Sam Loft 8]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: Sam Loft 8
<<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
<<set $loft_sam to 1>><<set $loft_upgrade += 1>>

You head to the loft with the gift in hand. It takes a few moments and you set the machine up. It is as easy as Sam said it would be.
<br><br>
<span class="gold">You can now brew coffee in the loft!</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage Loft]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
